Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Episode 2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd a Jaggy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's sleeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an escaped inmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunt out. Use this kid and capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're close to\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.32,0:01:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.58,0:01:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way,\Nmarks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining brightly, oh, who\Nknows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.82,0:02:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Reliquity lost that round, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mama as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She could be anywhere\Nafter falling like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try climbing the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He will just kick us down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of a tumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we\Nsurvived without a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle that Chaka\Nlanded right side off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we're just supposed to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of us power users fall off\Nthe ship, we'll be as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's what happened to Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked Mama's Vivi card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it says she's\Nstill among the Lickety Living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So she didn't drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's just water down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That probably means the\NBeast Pirates hauled her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,up from the sea and\Nlocked her away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That complicates things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think they'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Kaido were\Ncrewmates many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But since they're both emperors now, they're\Nonly interested in coming out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, they'll kill her for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's gonna happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The era of the big mom pirates will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they'll become the Pharaoh\NSparrow Pirates, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the next captain\Nshould obviously be Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But our crew values seniority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quality is what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The eldest son should be the\NLickety Leader, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it. Don't cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama won't die so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not some mere commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Big Mom? A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a strong lady from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, ma-ma-ma-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This shark-a-dile is so tame and\Nsweet, it even lets us run on its back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, after you pounded\Nit on the head twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, but why are you going\Ninto Udon with this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you're saying\Nmakes a bit of sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you she's real strong,\Nso she'll help us save Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is making my head spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come back for now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can work all of this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kin'emon has left me with a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was to guard Lord Momonosuke in his\Nabsence, as if my life depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On my honor as a kunoichi, I vow that\Nno harm will come to the young lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've barely even started your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being ridiculous and return home before\Nsomething bad happens to you yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Hitetsu, I'm afraid\Nwe're already on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, turn back. I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable, Lady Okiku. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see you for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye. Da-lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The name Big Mom sounds\Nawfully familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Olene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends were so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had fun in Okobore town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But they welcomed me like a guest and\Neven gave me a sweet treat to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Her talking hat hasn't said a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean it's lost its memory, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all coming back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The flavor of that sweet\Nsoup melting in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it, Topper-Abon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute and sweet,\NI could just eat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you! I'm not food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard, Momo. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at the center of\Nthis conflict, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Most inconsiderate of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's that thing you\Nsay when you swing your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsunachi or something, it sounds like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a word that fills you with energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,quite enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn such a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what they yell in sword fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Overseas, Zoro Giri taught it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it's a good luck word to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,uplift your spirit when\Nyour courage falters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I forbid you to\Nsay it. What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's merely a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but the same word was once\Nused in an old Kuri dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not appropriate for a person\Nof your standing to say. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What harm does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But it gives you energy\Nand I think it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid no means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positively famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me we've made it\Nto Udon and I can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really use a snack, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't drool and talk about\Nsnacks when you look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Oline, but I'm afraid we\Nstill have quite a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, surely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a rough\Nmap of the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we have six regions, each\Nwith a different climate than the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're divided by a river that\Nstretches across the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,colored rice a secret message from\Nshinobu no doubt wait at the dried up well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that seems convenient\Nenough i am relieved to find
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you in good health though\Nyour pursuers must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,persistent indeed if you fled\Nall the way here to ringo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But rest assured, Orochi's\Nmen will not follow this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still shocked that\Nthey would kill Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She was quite beloved. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The incident has thrown the\Nflower capital into an uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She wasn't a threat to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But the second she stood up to\NOrochi, they cut her right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai, you're scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who killed her is a Yakuza\Nboss known as Napping Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is not familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I am quite familiar with the most\Nfamous Yakuza boss from 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was called Hiogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A rather extravagant name, but I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiogoro was a man of\Nhonor who helped the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He would never have\Ndone such a cruel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like this Kyoshiro fellow\Nis quite the loathsome beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, perhaps we shouldn't have\Ntaken Otoko back to his pleasure hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely what he did was\Njust a show of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think he would go out of his way to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,kill a child over a minor\Ninfraction like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he killed the Oiron who worked\Nfor him, and she was a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We should check on her. Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're headed back to the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,let's have a nice warm soak in one of\Ntheir bathhouses to rest our weary bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi controls every\Naspect of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, that applies to bath\Nwater just as well as drinking water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One question first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Robi, perchance were you able to\Ncollect any valuable information?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'll share my meager scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what time Orochi will\Nwake up on the day of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what offerings they will\Ntake with them to Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Kaido's favorite food\Nand his crew's hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And the number of soldiers\Nand weapons that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's meager?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I happened upon a poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, it wasn't a red one, though. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're two for two on\Nfinding those, Bonkichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in a basement room\Nwith a reinforced door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An odd place full of wooden dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be a road poneglyph\Nhere, but if it's not in the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we can assume it's on Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's Island, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've acquired a treasure\NTraffy of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission was a resounding success.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To have such reliable\Nallies is truly a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Since all that's settled, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a nice healing bath\Nand also see some panties, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll stand out and\Nyou're a pervert! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking news!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's favorite Oiran, Komurasaki, met\Na terrible fate at the Shogun's Banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a big disagreement\Nand Kyoshiro cut her right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out more right here! Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're\Nbeing a bit dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You only saw her once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world should mourn\Nthe death of a beauty like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the funeral's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heartless, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My raid suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think Odobee and\Nthe others got caught, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I should try\Nto contact them by smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where to use this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the women's bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So much skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, whatever Usopp just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Traffy, is there\Nanything about Udon in the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,About Lufitaro, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hasn't gone on a rampage\Nyet, it's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't wait to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No article on Straw Hat, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass, that dirty rat is here? Dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he sneaking to the bath before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he was in 102.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been working with Hawkins,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so when I saw him, I should have guessed\Nhis partner would be here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or ex-partner, since it says here\Nhe escaped from the prison in Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just him, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So Luffy is still locked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and this is going to make it\Neven harder for him to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you think they\Nhave nice bathhouses there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not listening at all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My crew went scouting, but\Nthey haven't come back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't something go right for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you've heard,\NEustass Kid has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to bet you\Nknow something about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you even helped him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten this much in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm overwhelmed with gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I eat this food with a grateful\Nstomach and a heart full of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna share some\Nof those with me? Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're having\Na feast over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You sticking up for your pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of a coincidence that kid\Ndisappears right after you got sent here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you chatting it up; we all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really grossing me out, oh\Nyeah, well learn to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because as long as you've\Ngot those cuffs on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you ain't doing crap—it's\Nonly a matter of time before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,before your pal gets caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, he didn't think\Nthings through before he bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, he still has the\NC-prism stone cuffs on. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll round him up in no\Ntime and make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, your spit\Nstings cut it out. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sounds like you're\Npicking a fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, how about I go over the rules again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first events, both\Nyour arms will be cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For the second events,\Nwe chop off your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're naughty a third\Ntime, then you'll die, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So mind your manners, because if you\Nscrew with me, you're dead, dead, dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a poor old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you hard-working individuals\Nwouldn't tolerate a cheater like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone can't follow them, then\Nthey forfeit their right to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only fair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't work, then you should\Nstep aside and starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the polite thing\Nto do, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop being rude, old man. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to crawl away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand up straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did you\Nget all these food tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave them to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you steal them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Greedy, old piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stuffing them in\Nyour mouth, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to eat anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me, you old fart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't earn a damn\Nbite! Spit them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit them out, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never spit them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These were a gift from\Nmy savior, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never, ever let them go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let that be a lesson to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same will happen to you\Nif you don't fix that attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Better keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumplings and the name of the\Nidiot who gave you those tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to piss me off,\Nthen you've done a fine job, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave you the food tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's breaking the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just some punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But the person who gave me\Nthose tickets is a man of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He protects the weak from the mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must meet that chivalry with my\Nown, lest I be disgraced before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting a man like that made\Nme think of bygone days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, they called\Nme Hyogoro the Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After so long, my stomach is full\Nand my heart is filled with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a land of samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There used to be a bunch of men like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich in courage and pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you bastards killed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lufitaro, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of you\Nfor a lifetime. You know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,what happens when you\Ntalk back to the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then kill me, you damn thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're a damn thug, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All you know is violence, you\Ndon't have an ounce of pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wanted to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you conquered us because we lost our\Nspines and forgot what we were made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, old man, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash your skull then!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hit a guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Tyro! Hey! Hold that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stay back! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General type, who go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever attacks one of the\Nguards will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we all saw it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't talk your way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No more mercy. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General Solitaire, the keys have been
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,stolen. Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone made off with the keys\Nto the C-PRISM stone cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone see who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it was some guy\Nwith a freakishly huge head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me I dropped the key that\Nhad me replace it with a fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a thick shell, but he\Ntaunted me about walking sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even try to butter me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I ought to make you into a bisque!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be in the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Search high and low in the attic too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have fulfilled my duty\Nas a ninja splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must simply deliver the\Nkeys. Onward! He's here. Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.32,0:21:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a shooter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could have finished sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the wait, Sir\NLuffy, but I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your freedom is close at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, a stealthy departure. Beep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, Queen, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Master. Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, Queen, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen! Queen! Queen! Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master. Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Elite performer has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.58,0:23:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.01,0:24:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.23,0:24:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.71,0:24:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.19,0:24:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill! Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.10,0:24:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Why is it so noisy in\Nthere? Kill Em! Kill Em! Kill Em!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.01,0:24:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.92,0:24:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Em!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so brave, but now\Nthere's nothing he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you Louvetaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, this is it for Omen! You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You did great, Mrs. Starhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.49,0:24:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.40,0:24:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.23,0:24:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.14,0:24:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't resist. It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win with those cuffs on anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.97,0:24:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, then fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.79,0:24:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.71,0:24:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.62,0:24:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he able to fight\Nlike that with the cuffs on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We followed regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.45,0:24:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So just like all the\Nother powered prisoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,he should be just strong enough to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.27,0:24:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's to say, he's only about\Nas tough as a regular schmuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.18,0:24:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm weaker than\Na regular schmuck? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.60,0:25:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sea Prism Stone is doing its job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.38,0:25:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the man has resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.44,0:25:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pushing through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.34,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Warden here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't like having you violate\Nthe laws of physics in my prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has been great training for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.74,0:25:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time I get these things off, I\Nknow I'm going to be stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working hard for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But in reality, you have none.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use a good sparring\Npartner, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.86,0:25:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rather cocky,\Naren't you? Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.00,0:25:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll put you in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.82,0:26:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant smart chew!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now sneeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.56,0:26:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked bad, Mr. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.90,0:26:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.64,0:26:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Babanuki, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen arrived a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.48,0:26:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.24,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Queen already started his show\Nand I get there late, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.02,0:26:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.06,0:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even use my Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.90,0:27:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm getting pumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too good for oral jeep, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.86,0:27:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so even is combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.56,0:27:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.62,0:27:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop by the brothel\Nonce I'm done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger, Zach!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.92,0:27:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should tell\Nhim that Komorosaki's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill us for sure, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let someone else do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.80,0:28:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.48,0:28:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lose no weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.26,0:28:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,just more to appreciate I got enough fans
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.84,0:28:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Attracted to my fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I look round as a ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.06,0:28:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but all of this is muscle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,y 'all These Bombs moves of\Nmine are powered by my fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting,\Nyou pieces of shit
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.48,0:28:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Climb up. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.52,0:29:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.84,0:29:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay it on me one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.02,0:29:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's got to be in your bonnet today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Baba Nuki's top three pains in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.54,0:29:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass Kidd has escaped from the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.30,0:29:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.06,0:29:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The keys to the sea prism stone\Nhandcuffs have been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado? Mm-mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.42,0:29:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Emmy number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.02,0:29:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy's running wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.12,0:29:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.90,0:29:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.54,0:29:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry a bit, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This house is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.98,0:29:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to use it as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.06,0:30:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're pals with Zoro Shura, then that\Nmakes the two of you Aqua in my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.62,0:30:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's hardly worth thanking me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty houses are opening up left and right.\NBecause people keep starving to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You fellas sure are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.70,0:30:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing the joke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he just likes to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when you're this hungry,\Nyou either laugh or you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, bad timing, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.10,0:30:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You just missed Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.98,0:30:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can you tell us\Nwhere he went? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.12,0:30:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He dashed out the door before\NI could ask where he was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.42,0:30:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Said his sword was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.80,0:30:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have seen his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.62,0:30:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how far the\Npoor man's gone by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.50,0:30:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he did get his sword,\Nhe'll never find his way back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.22,0:30:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, shouldn't Blackleg\Nbe with us right now, too? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.70,0:30:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where to use this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the women's bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.88,0:31:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you think they\Nhave nice bathhouses there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.84,0:31:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what baths are like here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.84,0:31:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's a bit too\Nhot for my taste, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,People around here like to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.48,0:31:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they keep it this hot just so\Nthey can say, is it chilly in here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.94,0:31:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess there are lots of things\Nabout this place I don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it too hot for you to get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.36,0:31:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so bad after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It would leave me feeling a\Nbit defenseless, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What if an enemy showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.08,0:31:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As cautious as a ninja,\Na fine trait to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.34,0:31:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Order B and I are both magic users,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.82,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only natural that we're\Nwary when we take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.92,0:32:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.60,0:32:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Her enemies might not\Nbother me, but they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.42,0:32:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I charge a viewing fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.88,0:32:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A mixed bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound awfully surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.94,0:32:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think anything of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.60,0:32:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but perhaps mixed baths are\Nuncommon where you're from?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.20,0:32:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty boys gawking at you\Nis nothing unusual in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I can blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.60,0:32:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural they'd\Nwant a little peek at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.38,0:32:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your hearts out, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.22,0:32:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.32,0:32:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Neen-ho! Bowcrusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.90,0:33:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the washing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After we've warmed up in the bath, we\Nhave Sansa-kay wash our bags. Sansa-kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.88,0:33:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.98,0:33:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.72,0:33:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sansa-kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A title we give to the experts who\Nscrub our backs at the bathhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.18,0:33:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why an octopus, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he has eight limbs, that\Nmakes him a real pro at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.88,0:33:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty handy, right? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.92,0:33:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro creeps me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.68,0:33:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get inside his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't trust the Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.70,0:33:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, you young folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.68,0:33:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yakuza in this country\Nare allies to the common man!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.00,0:33:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or they were back in my day, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.60,0:33:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Their old boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.42,0:33:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a great man named\NHyogoro, the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.88,0:34:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the person Kanjuro was\Ntalking about before? Though I am
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.60,0:34:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,quite familiar with the most famous\Nyakuza boss from 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He was called hyogoro the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.08,0:34:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro was indeed a man\Nof courage and honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.68,0:34:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he was with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.96,0:34:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai would heed his call.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.44,0:34:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.70,0:34:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt we'll be able to recruit\N5 000 troops without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.50,0:34:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,500 may be the best we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.82,0:34:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.46,0:34:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.06,0:34:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago, he was the most\Ninfluential man in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was always pulling strings behind\Nthe scenes in the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.22,0:34:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He won the respect of\Nthe Yakuza bosses in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the other regions of the\Nland of Wano as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.84,0:34:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Known for his chivalry and charisma,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.98,0:34:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he would protect those in\Nneed when the law could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.80,0:34:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was strong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was why even Lord\NOdin looked up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.98,0:34:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So is there a reason why\Nwe can't recruit this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.88,0:35:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been over 20\Nyears since he was in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, no one knows where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.30,0:35:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Most believe that he was killed by\NOrochi when he refused to serve his clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.79,0:35:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the leader of the Oniwa Banshu, once\Nsupported the Kozuki clan alongside Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.92,0:35:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But he decided to take\Nthe opposite path from
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.24,0:35:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyogoro and pledges loyalty\Nto Orochi these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.98,0:35:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked for him when he first changed\Nsides, but I couldn't take it and ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.32,0:35:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From that day forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.92,0:35:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I became their enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.02,0:35:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.64,0:35:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.02,0:35:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Highness you're still alive\Nyou bewitching vixen you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seductress Kunoichi. That's\Nwhy that ninja knew you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.82,0:35:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool you're famous
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.18,0:35:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a shame, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.60,0:35:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss Yoguro, but he's nothing\Nmore than a piece of history now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.48,0:36:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times are you going\Nto make me say it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just join our crew and Kaido\Nwill pardon you for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.40,0:36:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're not going to\Nget a better deal than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.24,0:36:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.68,0:36:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is truly unfortunate timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.86,0:36:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy, I have the key you need...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.22,0:36:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet this looks real familiar, Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.58,0:36:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, Kaido and Orochi wanted you\Non their side pretty badly back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.84,0:36:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, the big fancy Yakuza boss is\Nnothing but a malnourished old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you'd wish you'd taken\Nthat offer back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.26,0:36:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he say Hyogoro? But that\Nold man's so tiny you could pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.82,0:36:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,him up with one hand my days are\Npast but please don't let mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat it up like me\Nhave mercy i beg of you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.26,0:37:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.02,0:37:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.88,0:37:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a\Nbit since I last saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.14,0:37:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.38,0:37:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gazes from the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.74,0:37:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.74,0:37:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What of Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.74,0:37:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.18,0:37:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.94,0:37:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.04,0:37:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
